      <p class="lead">School management software made for Indian schools: admissions, fee management and receipts, attendance with WhatsApp alerts, exams and report cards, staff salary, transport and the school store. On the computer and on the phone.</p>
      <div class="hero-btns">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Book a free demo<i class="bx bx-right-arrow-alt"></i></a>
        <a href="@loginUrl" class="btn btn-glass btn-lg"><i class="bx bx-lock-alt"></i>Login to your school</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="hero-ticks">
        <li><i class="bx bx-check"></i>Your data brought in from Excel</li>
        <li><i class="bx bx-check"></i>Staff trained by us</li>
        <li><i class="bx bx-check"></i>Works on any phone</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-shot" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="lap">
        <div class="lid">
          <div class="screen">
            <aside class="scr-side">
              <img src="~/img/brand/ssw-icon.svg" alt="" />
              <i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i>
            </aside>
            <div class="scr-main">
              <div class="scr-hi"><b>Good morning, Principal</b><small>Today at a glance</small></div>
              <div class="slots">
                <div class="tile p-id"><small>Students</small><b>1,240</b><span>+38 this session</span></div>
                <div class="tile p-reg"><small>Present today</small><b>96.4%</b><span>1,195 marked</span></div>
                <div class="tile p-rcpt"><small>Fees today</small><b>₹1,86,400</b><span>74 receipts</span></div>
                <div class="tile p-rc"><small>Results</small><b>Published</b><span>Half yearly · 312 cards</span></div>
                <div class="tile chart p-coins"><small>Fee collection · Apr–Oct</small><div class="bars"><i style="--h:55%"></i><i style="--h:42%"></i><i style="--h:50%"></i><i style="--h:66%"></i><i style="--h:54%"></i><i style="--h:72%"></i><i class="hl" style="--h:90%"></i></div></div>
                <div class="tile p-tt"><small>Timetable</small><b>No clashes</b><span>3 substitutes today</span></div>
                <div class="tile p-bus"><small>Transport</small><b>6 routes</b><span>418 riders on board</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="base"></div>
        <div class="wa-note"><i class="bx bxl-whatsapp"></i><div><b>Absent alert sent</b><small>Parents of 12 students</small></div></div>
      </div>
